@startuml
title Resumefolio | Elicitation recording and review
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #64748B
skinparam activity {
 BackgroundColor #DBEAFE
 BorderColor #64748B
 FontColor #17324D
 DiamondBackgroundColor #FEF3C7
 DiamondBorderColor #B45309
 StartColor #17324D
 EndColor #17324D
}
start
:Identify actual activity, date, method and coverage;
:Record participants or exact inspected source / revision;
:Capture labeled statement, paraphrase or observation;
:Separate interpretation, assumptions and proposed solutions;
:Check source fidelity, context and existing decision authority;
if (Actual interpretation review performed?) then (yes)
 :Record feedback, reviewer / date and reviewed scope; <<#DCFCE7>>
else (not yet)
 :Keep interpretation pending owner review; <<#FEF3C7>>
endif
:Record open detail, conflicts, owner and dependent gate;
:Link actual requirements / scenarios / questions when allocated;
:Preserve source locator, record identity and correction history;
stop
legend bottom
Document analysis needs inspected material, not invented interview participants.
Source decision date and actual extraction date are different facts.
An extract does not allocate or accept a detailed product requirement.
endlegend
@enduml
